{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the world of <i>Here Comes the Swarm</i> with responsive controls and thoughtfully designed building systems that feel second nature to any seasoned or first-time RTS player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in the Demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial Experience</strong> - Learn the basics in a guided tutorial covering settlement building, resource management and defensive tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish Mode</strong> - Jump into a shortened skirmish with full tier 1 content;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core city-building and production buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic military and defense structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical pause to plan and react under pressure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deity</strong>\u00a0- Worship \u201cTiamman,\u201d the defensive deity who grants protective boons and blessings to fortify your stronghold and enhance your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essences</strong> - Unlock and configure unique Essences that let you tailor gameplay to your preferred strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/4100449d06edd2d0f6df9681683664f4.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=18 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The hive is <strong>angry</strong>. They have <i>claimed</i> this planet. <i>Today, today, today</i>, they whisper to their brothers, to their sisters. The swarm <i>shivers</i> in anticipation. They click, they chitter, they <strong>burst</strong>. <i>Today, today, today</i>. They move as a river, a steady stream, towards the camp of the walking machines. In unison they chant: <strong>we kill, we kill, we kill</strong>. <br><br>Will you stop them? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/12bc66430051cbec07afe512a4d46c81.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your settlement is <i>crucial</i> in <strong>Here Comes The Swarm</strong>. Gather enough resources for upgrades and expansion while keeping your population <i>fed and happy</i>. Make sure your defenses are <strong>ready</strong> when <strong>the swarm</strong> comes. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/31f6cbb1c68fbd38eacd3b5b0a700073.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the army <i>you</i> want, and train your units to ready them for the hive's <strong>strongest enemies</strong>. Strength comes in numbers for <strong>the swarm</strong>, and their onslaught will be <strong>unrelenting</strong>. Get ready to find <i>thousands</i> of fiends trying to breach your walls. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/553623a4c854a5ef01434bec278fb079.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between various <strong>deities</strong> and their <i>divine powers</i> to help you on your journey. Their blessings may very well be the difference between <strong>survival and defeat</strong>. Will you focus on attack, defense, or something <i>completely different</i>? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/8d3aa1b903ed1ba4f49fcbea868dd728.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Arcane essences</strong> on your <strong>skirmishes</strong> to upgrade your <strong>Arcanum</strong>, unlocking new, <strong>powerful nodes</strong> that will <i>change the game</i>. Choose between these new boons to further <i>tailor the game</i> to your own preference. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e679b2b23f89ad92d09e08cc81f925be.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let time be your enemy; make <i>tactical decisions</i> by <strong>pausing</strong> the game during critical moments. You can plan the building of your base, assign army movement, or use it to make yourself a hot drink: you deserve it. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682340?t=1755956365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/fb8ba07667e057432550eb5fe6a566c49daaba5c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755956365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/701ab253b7837a8990e3c669c136e6ed5ffe1694/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755956365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/701ab253b7837a8990e3c669c136e6ed5ffe1694/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755956365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game features frequent combat against alien creatures known as the Swarm, as well as the possibility of human characters being killed by these creatures. Players may encounter visual depictions of blood, dismemberment, and decaying corpses for both humans and aliens, contributing to the game's intense and mature atmosphere."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the world of <i>Here Comes the Swarm</i> with responsive controls and thoughtfully designed building systems that feel second nature to any seasoned or first-time RTS player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in the Demo?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial Experience</strong> - Learn the basics in a guided tutorial covering settlement building, resource management and defensive tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish Mode</strong> - Jump into a shortened skirmish with full tier 1 content;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core city-building and production buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic military and defense structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical pause to plan and react under pressure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deity</strong>\u00a0- Worship \u201cTiamman,\u201d the defensive deity who grants protective boons and blessings to fortify your stronghold and enhance your defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essences</strong> - Unlock and configure unique Essences that let you tailor gameplay to your preferred strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/4100449d06edd2d0f6df9681683664f4.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=18 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The hive is <strong>angry</strong>. They have <i>claimed</i> this planet. <i>Today, today, today</i>, they whisper to their brothers, to their sisters. The swarm <i>shivers</i> in anticipation. They click, they chitter, they <strong>burst</strong>. <i>Today, today, today</i>. They move as a river, a steady stream, towards the camp of the walking machines. In unison they chant: <strong>we kill, we kill, we kill</strong>. <br><br>Will you stop them? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/12bc66430051cbec07afe512a4d46c81.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/9ed48293bd02ba97a6335c807b5860bf.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your settlement is <i>crucial</i> in <strong>Here Comes The Swarm</strong>. Gather enough resources for upgrades and expansion while keeping your population <i>fed and happy</i>. Make sure your defenses are <strong>ready</strong> when <strong>the swarm</strong> comes. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/31f6cbb1c68fbd38eacd3b5b0a700073.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/60b5d69408129c9acef4a2965006f5f2.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the army <i>you</i> want, and train your units to ready them for the hive's <strong>strongest enemies</strong>. Strength comes in numbers for <strong>the swarm</strong>, and their onslaught will be <strong>unrelenting</strong>. Get ready to find <i>thousands</i> of fiends trying to breach your walls. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/553623a4c854a5ef01434bec278fb079.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e35369f5ba393c1eb16c0f0b618779f4.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between various <strong>deities</strong> and their <i>divine powers</i> to help you on your journey. Their blessings may very well be the difference between <strong>survival and defeat</strong>. Will you focus on attack, defense, or something <i>completely different</i>? </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/8d3aa1b903ed1ba4f49fcbea868dd728.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.poster.avif?t=1755956365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.webm?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/99593518b1718ae5929bd88a614e16ad.mp4?t=1755956365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>Arcane essences</strong> on your <strong>skirmishes</strong> to upgrade your <strong>Arcanum</strong>, unlocking new, <strong>powerful nodes</strong> that will <i>change the game</i>. Choose between these new boons to further <i>tailor the game</i> to your own preference. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/extras/e679b2b23f89ad92d09e08cc81f925be.avif?t=1755956365\" width=614 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let time be your enemy; make <i>tactical decisions</i> by <strong>pausing</strong> the game during critical moments. You can plan the building of your base, assign army movement, or use it to make yourself a hot drink: you deserve it. </p>","developers":["CableHook Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3052730","name":"Here Comes The Swarm"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682340/0e3e4ad45501195000e902872508b49bd7c3dcc6/header.jpg?t=1755956365","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257176198,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176198/movie480.mp4?t=1755811556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176198/movie_max.mp4?t=1755811556"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer | Here Comes The Swarm - Demo Edition","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176198/9b65645f346a7e17510c75d5fec1a81330627b1f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755811556","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176198/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755811556","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176198/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755811556"}}],"name":"Here Comes The Swarm - Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 570</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["CableHook Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"21 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id"